# NAME: AI-Google
# UPDATED: 2026-09-05 00:00:00
# AI.list 的 Google 子集, 与 AI.list 的 Google 段逐条一致, 改动时两处同步
# 用法: Surge 规则自上而下, 首个匹配生效; 把 RULE-SET AI-Google 放在 RULE-SET AI 之前, 即可单独指定 Google 家 AI 的出口
# 注意: apis.google.com 与 oauth2.googleapis.com 是 Google 全家共用的 gapi / OAuth token 端点, Gemini 与 Antigravity 登录依赖它们,
# 但 Surge 对 HTTPS 无法按路径区分, 故整域保留. 前置本清单后这两条会跟着 Google 出口走, 与其余 Google 账号流量同节点, 这是有意为之

# > Google Gemini
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,apis.google.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,bard.google.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,gemini.google
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,gemini.google.com

# > Google AI & DeepMind
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,ai.google
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,deepmind.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,deepmind.google

# > Google Generative Language API
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,generativelanguage.googleapis.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,geller-pa.googleapis.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,proactivebackend-pa.googleapis.com

# > Google Vertex AI (含 {region}-aiplatform 前缀主机)
DOMAIN-KEYWORD,aiplatform.googleapis.com

# > Google AI Studio
DOMAIN,alkalimakersuite-pa.clients6.google.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,ai.dev
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,aistudio.google.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,makersuite.google.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,generativeai.google
DOMAIN,ai.google.dev
DOMAIN,alkalicore-pa.clients6.google.com
DOMAIN,waa-pa.clients6.google.com

# > Google NotebookLM
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,notebooklm.google
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,notebooklm.google.com

# > Google Jules
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,jules.google
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,jules.google.com

# > Google Labs (Flow / Whisk / ImageFX)
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,labs.google

# > Google Stitch
DOMAIN,stitch.withgoogle.com

# > Google Antigravity
DOMAIN,oauth2.googleapis.com
DOMAIN,cloudcode-pa.googleapis.com
DOMAIN,daily-cloudcode-pa.sandbox.googleapis.com
DOMAIN,daily-cloudcode-pa.googleapis.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,antigravity-unleash.goog
